#: includes/oauth-connectors.php:1131
msgid ""
"That is a metadata URL, but its host is not among this site's allowed "
"callback URLs, so the document is never fetched. Add a callback URL on that "
"host under Settings › WP Abilities › Connection."
msgstr ""
"Es una URL de metadatos, pero su host no está entre las URLs de callback "
"permitidas de este sitio, así que el documento nunca se descarga. Añade una "
"URL de callback de ese host en Ajustes › WP Abilities › Conexión."

#: includes/oauth-connectors.php:1132
msgid ""
"That is an opaque ID, so it should have been issued by this site. Remove and "
"re-add the connector so it registers itself, or create a client under "
"Settings › WP Abilities › Connection and paste that exact Client ID."
msgstr ""
"Es un ID opaco, así que debería haberlo emitido este sitio. Elimina y vuelve "
"a añadir el conector para que se registre, o crea un cliente en Ajustes › WP "
"Abilities › Conexión y pega exactamente ese Client ID."

